      "created_at": "2012-06-09T05:44:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>At the start of a turn, let’s say the Mask is in the Matriarch’s trash.  Matriarch plays Darken the Skies.  The Mask comes back.  Does it go off immediately?  Meaning, since a non-fowl card was played (Darken the Skies, or even the Mask itself), she will play the top card of the Villain deck.</p>\n<p>I’ve always played that it does.  Am I making things too hard on myself?  I couldn’t find any clarification here.</p>",
