      "created_at": "2012-06-09T05:54:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve always played that it does NOT trigger.  The reason being, the mask triggers off the playing a non-fowl card, and Darken the Skies has already been “played” (and is resolving) in order to bring the mask back.  I make no claim that this is an official ruling, it’s just how we’ve played it.</p>",
