      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-09T06:31:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I came here to back the interpretation that the next villan card would be played.   However, after reading through the thread and some careful deliberations,  I am (slightly) inclined to agree with broccoli.</p>\n<p>Presumeably a card enters play before its text is applicable.  Therefore the time for the effects of the mask would already be passed once the mask enters play.</p>",
