      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-09T06:34:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Agreed, DtS is already processing its effects thus it is already in play and cannot “enters play” again, and that’s the key phrase on the Mask.</p>\n<p>Edit: Huh, never noticed it before but it’s “each turn” meaning playing with the Pillars of Hercules in play (or a similar environment) where the top card of the villain deck is played every turn could cause the matriarch to flip many times during a single round, scary thought.</p>",
