      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-09T15:55:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Like I said, I had always gone ahead and kept playing cards, like awp - I learned from him.  But that choice in wording is what brought me here.</p>\n<p>There was no point to killing the Mask before - it would just come back right away and keep on chugging.  That also eventually tipped me off that something may be off.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\">  Anyway, the Matriarch is about to get easier.  And I’ll have to start killing that thing.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:07:13.154Z",
