      "raw": "Like I said, I had always gone ahead and kept playing cards, like awp - I learned from him.  But that choice in wording is what brought me here.\n\nThere was no point to killing the Mask before - it would just come back right away and keep on chugging.  That also eventually tipped me off that something may be off.  :)  Anyway, the Matriarch is about to get easier.  And I'll have to start killing that thing.",
